{
  "name": "theta-h2-earnings",
  "notes": "PRE-REGISTERED H2 (ADR-0265, Amendment 5), development period 2016-01-04 .. 2021-01-01 (end_before; nothing on or after 2026-01-01 is read). ADR RULE, verbatim: **H2** earnings: (a) implied move (front straddle) minus realized gap move; (b) long ATM straddle bought 3 sessions before the event, sold the session after, at NBBO. Events are detected from the chain itself (front-month IV collapse above a threshold frozen on 2016–2019 dates). Pass: mean > 0, t clustered by event week >= 2.5, same sign in both halves, terciles by liquidity. COMMON (ADR-0265 decisions 1-4): Split. Development 2016-01-04..2020-12-31; validation 2021-01-04..2025-12-31, run once per hypothesis, unchanged, only if the development run passed; 2024-25 is a labelled subperiod, never the sole basis of a pass; 2026 stays sealed. Universe gate: a root enters a test only from its first date with bid > 0 (the census); roots are stitched across renames. Cost model: buy at the ask, sell at the bid (NBBO); no mid fills; `close` is never a mark; our own Black-76 implied vol from the mid and the parity forward. Multiple testing: Benjamini-Hochberg 5% within a hypothesis's feature family; Bonferroni across the families for any headline claim; secondary analyses are reported, never promoted. This is the development run. Run from children/index_options, niced, after the census, the universe freeze and the panel (ADR-0265 Amendment 5 run book): nice -n 10 python -m dskit.pipeline run configs/run-theta-h2-earnings.json --asof 2025-12-31",
  "outputs": {
    "run_root": "/home/russell/data/index_options/theta-research-20261012/hypotheses/h2-earnings",
    "notes": "Beside the other research runs; nothing is written under /home/russell/data/thetadata. Excluded from the identity hash."
  },
  "pipeline": {
